{"id":"529c7a4180269a30","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-srandom-gale.md","title":"强 s 随机的 supergale 刻画","display":"thm-srandom-gale — 强 s 随机的 supergale 刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-srandom-gale","aliases":["43-thm-srandom-gale"],"display":"thm-srandom-gale — 强 s 随机的 supergale 刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-srandom]]","[[43-df-s-supergale]]","[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]","[[43-df-sgale-success]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Thm.17.4.7, printed p.520 / PDF p.540","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-srandom-gale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-srandom-gale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-srandom-gale — 强 s 随机的 supergale 刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7b7bb0c1682f4d07\" href=\"?note=7b7bb0c1682f4d07\" title=\"43-df-srandom\">43-df-srandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9049b31bf7443246\" href=\"?note=9049b31bf7443246\" title=\"43-df-s-supergale\">43-df-s-supergale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc3ac987908461b8\" href=\"?note=cc3ac987908461b8\" title=\"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function\">43-df-lower-semicomputable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"22bbacf3e5b5ce70\" href=\"?note=22bbacf3e5b5ce70\" title=\"43-df-sgale-success\">43-df-sgale-success</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Thm.17.4.7, printed p.520 / PDF p.540"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7b7bb0c1682f4d07\" href=\"?note=7b7bb0c1682f4d07\" title=\"43-df-srandom\">43-df-srandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9049b31bf7443246\" href=\"?note=9049b31bf7443246\" title=\"43-df-s-supergale\">43-df-s-supergale</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cc3ac987908461b8\" href=\"?note=cc3ac987908461b8\" title=\"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function\">43-df-lower-semicomputable-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"22bbacf3e5b5ce70\" href=\"?note=22bbacf3e5b5ce70\" title=\"43-df-sgale-success\">43-df-sgale-success</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongSRandom}_s(X)\\iff\\forall d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;[(\\mathrm{Supergale}_s(d)\\land\\mathrm{LSC}(d))\\Rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Success}^s(d,X)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{StrongSRandom}_s(X)\\iff\\forall d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;[(\\mathrm{Supergale}_s(d)\\land\\mathrm{LSC}(d))\\Rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Success}^s(d,X)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>书解释一般弱 s 测试无法直接处理祖先与子串重复出现的权重，强测试用任意前缀自由子集消除这个问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis",